WEBVTT

00:33:57.746 --> 00:34:03.329
That's poetic justice to your poetry. Yeah
, write your poetry fashion.

00:34:04.371 --> 00:34:06.829
And then I was talking with
my sister the other day,

00:34:06.829 --> 00:34:09.913
and she said that if she could have
dinner with anyone on Earth,

00:34:09.913 --> 00:34:13.538
you'd be at her table, which, of course,

00:34:13.538 --> 00:34:15.496
made me wonder who would be at your table.

00:34:15.829 --> 00:34:17.996
Are there are people you would
most like to sit down with

00:34:17.996 --> 00:34:19.746
and learn from that you've never met

00:34:20.038 --> 00:34:22.079
or that you've only had limited
interaction with

00:34:24.246 --> 00:34:25.621
people who are alive today?

00:34:25.663 --> 00:34:31.954
Yes, I would really like to sit down
privately and have dinner with the pope.